ed \nThe description does not match the actual behavior, in fact it does the opposite.\n\n> \"If enabled, the CanvasLayer stays in a fixed position on the screen. If disabled, the CanvasLayer maintains its position in world space.\"\n\nThe GUI nodes (those labels) is in a canvaslayer that DISABLED follow_viewport_enabled, whitch would be \"maintains its position in world space\" according to the doc.\nBut apparently these GUI only \"fixed position on the screen\", not maintain in wolrd space.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7d30fd0c-843f-405e-a0be-4e74247cc85e)\n\nbegins of the camera movement\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5720eeeb-0028-42ed-b190-8fb944036237)\n\nend of the camera movement\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03b86615-bac3-48bd-91f3-b874fffa8d63)\n\n\n**MRP file:**\n[CanvasLayerFviewTest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18865420/CanvasLayerFviewTest.zip)\n\n\n_Originally posted by @rt9391 in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99754#issuecomment-2668164294_\n            ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public